{"id":"ca7404158049be33","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-term.md","title":"Term","display":"df-term — Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-term","aliases":["93-df-term"],"display":"df-term — Term","depends_on":["[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is a similarity type and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced similarity-type predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{app}_{93}\">\\(\\mathtt{app}_{93}\\)</span> is a constructor tag distinct from the sourced variable tag <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{vtag}_{93}\">\\(\\mathtt{vtag}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\)</span> is the tagged operation-application code.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(T^n_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(T_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{app}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle1,1\\rangle,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathtt{app}_{93},f,\\bar t\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{app}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle1,1\\rangle,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathtt{app}_{93},f,\\bar t\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{app}_{93}\\neq\\mathtt{vtag}_{93}\n\\land\\forall f,\\bar t\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\neq x\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{app}_{93}\\neq\\mathtt{vtag}_{93}\n\\land\\forall f,\\bar t\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\neq x\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\nT^0_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\coloneqq X,\\qquad\nT^{n+1}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\coloneqq\nT^n_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t):f\\in S\\land\n\\bar t\\in(T^n_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X))^{\\alpha(f)}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\nT^0_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\coloneqq X,\\qquad\nT^{n+1}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\coloneqq\nT^n_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t):f\\in S\\land\n\\bar t\\in(T^n_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X))^{\\alpha(f)}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\nT_{\\tau}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T^n_{\\tau}(X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\nT_{\\tau}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T^n_{\\tau}(X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The stage index gives a well-founded construction depth. The explicit application tag prevents a compound term from colliding with a raw variable code, independently of which sets are used as operation symbols. The complete similarity type, including its arity map, indexes every stage and the final term predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathtt{app}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathtt{vtag}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)","display":false},{"tex":"T^n_{\\tau}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\tau}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{app}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle1,1\\rangle,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathtt{app}_{93},f,\\bar t\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{app}_{93}\\neq\\mathtt{vtag}_{93}\n\\land\\forall f,\\bar t\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t)\\neq x\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\nT^0_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\coloneqq X,\\qquad\nT^{n+1}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\coloneqq\nT^n_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t):f\\in S\\land\n\\bar t\\in(T^n_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(X))^{\\alpha(f)}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\nT_{\\tau}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T^n_{\\tau}(X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":2017,"backlinks":[{"id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the tagged term constructor, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of [[93-df-homomorphism]], and $\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is defined here by recursion on the construction stage of [[93-df-term]]."},{"id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle$ is a similarity type, $X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$, and $T_{\\tau}(X)$ is the term set of [[93-df-term]]."},{"id":"f1eab1108defb738","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aadc5df21ecc6ba2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the collision-free tagged constructor of [[93-df-term]]; function-symbol arities are read from $\\mathcal L$."},{"id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$T_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})$ and $\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ are the term algebra and tagged c